# Emotion and moral judgement
#
# Only when the text states it. An emotion is never inferred from an action. No records use this y
# et.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m16_emotion> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Emotion and moral judgement" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E3_Condition_State

iy:Emotion a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:BodilyState .
iy:Grief a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Emotion .
iy:Anger a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Emotion .
iy:Remorse a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Emotion .
iy:MoralJudgement a owl:Class .

iy:experiencer a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:stimulus a owl:ObjectProperty .
